                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5badc91-196f-48ba-b404-1484b7a0f78a",
                                "sense_id": "c65ea7ba-3413-388a-a548-fa7d8c289078",
                                "text": "Some things are not knowable. If Pradeep Mathew had played for India or England, would he have gone on to be the greatest spinner of all time? Not knowable. How many poor bastards have perished in this bed before me? Not knowable."
